# Dependency honesty

## Required behavior

- Inspect `composer.json` / lock before recommending a library API.
- Prefer packages already installed; propose new requires explicitly.
- Do not invent Laravel packages or APIs in a CakePHP app.
- Keep require vs require-dev accurate (DebugKit/Bake usually require-dev).

## Anti-patterns

- Phantom packages
- Assuming optional plugins
- Moving prod-only tools into require-dev incorrectly without reason (and vice versa)
